facts:
**Acute** $0^{\circ}<\theta<90^{\circ}$; **right** $= 90^{\circ}$; **obtuse** between $90^{\circ}$ and $180^{\circ}$.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\usetikzlibrary{angles,calc}
\coordinate (V1) at (0,0);\coordinate (A1) at (1.5,0);\coordinate (B1) at (40:1.5);
\draw (A1)--(V1)--(B1);
\pic[draw,angle radius=0.45cm]{angle=A1--V1--B1};
\node[font=\small] at (0.75,-0.7) {acute};
\coordinate (V2) at (3.6,0);\coordinate (A2) at (5.1,0);\coordinate (B2) at (3.6,1.5);
\draw (A2)--(V2)--(B2);
\coordinate (a2) at ($(V2)!0.35cm!(A2)$);\coordinate (b2) at ($(V2)!0.35cm!(B2)$);
\draw (a2)--($(a2)+(b2)-(V2)$)--(b2);
\node[font=\small] at (4.35,-0.7) {right};
\coordinate (V3) at (7.6,0);\coordinate (A3) at (9.1,0);\coordinate (B3) at ($(V3)+(130:1.5)$);
\draw (A3)--(V3)--(B3);
\pic[draw,angle radius=0.45cm]{angle=A3--V3--B3};
\node[font=\small] at (7.6,-0.7) {obtuse};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

**Straight** $= 180^{\circ}$; **reflex** between $180^{\circ}$ and $360^{\circ}$.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\usetikzlibrary{angles,calc}
\coordinate (V1) at (1.5,0);\coordinate (A1) at (3,0);\coordinate (B1) at (0,0);
\draw (A1)--(V1)--(B1);\fill (V1) circle (1.5pt);
\pic[draw,angle radius=0.45cm]{angle=A1--V1--B1};
\node[font=\small] at (1.5,-0.9) {straight};
\coordinate (V2) at (5.6,0);\coordinate (A2) at (7.1,0);\coordinate (B2) at ($(V2)+(135:1.5)$);
\draw (A2)--(V2)--(B2);\fill (V2) circle (1.5pt);
\draw ($(V2)+(135:0.55)$) arc (135:360:0.55);
\node[font=\small] at ($(V2)+(258:1.25)$) {reflex};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

A full turn, or **revolution**, $= 360^{\circ}$.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\coordinate (V) at (0,0);
\draw (V)--(1.6,0);\fill (V) circle (1.5pt);
\draw[->] (12:0.7) arc (12:348:0.7);
\node[font=\small] at (0,-1.3) {revolution};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

